<http://purl.org/spar/mito/isMentionedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The relation between the two sides involved in the act of mentioning, with one entity being mentioned by the other."@en .
<http://purl.org/spar/mito/isMentionedBy> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
